{"sha": "db2449c8ace5fddbf253f80405ab604cc6a6f6c1abc50bcc6348e71a8036007b", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=9.2cm, height=5.6cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=4.2, ymin=-0.4, ymax=2.9,", "  xtick={0.5,2.2,2.7}, xticklabels={$a$,$x$,\\ $x+h$}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[name path=curve, omDef, thick, domain=0:3.9, samples=80]", "    {1 + 0.4*x + 0.2*sin(deg(2*x))};", "  \\path[name path=xaxis] (0,0) -- (3.9,0);", "  \\addplot[omDef!20] fill between[of=curve and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=0.5:2.2}];", "  \\addplot[omProp!40] fill between[of=curve and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=2.2:2.7}];", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:2.2,1.69) -- (axis cs:2.7,1.69);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:2.2,1.925) -- (axis cs:2.7,1.925)", "    node[above right, font=\\small] {$f(x+h)$};", "  \\node at (axis cs:1.35,0.6) {$F(x)$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 证明思路：增量 $F(x+h) - F(x)$ 是窄条（橙色）的面积，", "该窄条夹在高分别为", "$f(x)$ 与 $f(x+h)$、底长为 $h$ 的两个矩形之间。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proof}[当 $f$ 递增时的证明]", "取定 $x \\in I$ 及 $h > 0$，使 $x + h \\in I$。由 Chasles 关系，", "\\[", "F(x+h) - F(x) = \\int_x^{x+h} f(t)\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "因为 $f$ 递增，故 $f(x) \\leq f(t) \\leq f(x+h)$，", "其中 $t \\in \\intcc{x}{x+h}$，由积分的比较性质（", "常数 $c$ 在长为 $h$ 的区间上的积分为 $ch$）：", "\\[", "h\\,f(x) \\leq F(x+h) - F(x) \\leq h\\,f(x+h),", "\\]", "于是", "\\[", "f(x) \\leq \\frac{F(x+h) - F(x)}{h} \\leq f(x+h).", "\\]", "当 $h \\to 0^+$ 时，$f(x+h) \\to f(x)$（由连续性），再由夹逼定理，", "可知差商趋于 $f(x)$；$h < 0$ 的情形", "类似可证。因此 $F' = f$，且 $F(a) = 0$。一般（非单调）的", "连续情形将在大学阶段证明。", "", "最后，若 $G$ 为任一原函数，则 $G = F + c$", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:integ:primunique}），于是", "$G(b) - G(a) = F(b) - F(a) = \\int_a^b f$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x^2\\,\\dd x = \\left[\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^1 =", "\\frac13$：抛物线下方的面积是单位正方形面积的三分之一，", "正如阿基米德所知。", "\\end{example}", "", "原函数表可由导数表读出", "（$u$ 表示可导函数，$c$ 为任意常数）：", "\\begin{center}", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.7}", "\\begin{tabular}{c|c||c|c}", "$f(x)$ & 原函数 & $f$ & 原函数 \\\\", "\\hline", "$x^n \\ (n \\neq -1)$ & $\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1} + c$ &", "$u'u^n \\ (n \\neq -1)$ & $\\dfrac{u^{n+1}}{n+1} + c$\\\\", "$\\dfrac1x \\ (x > 0)$ & $\\ln x + c$ &", "$\\dfrac{u'}{u} \\ (u > 0)$ & $\\ln u + c$\\\\", "$\\eu^x$ & $\\eu^x + c$ &", "$u'\\eu^u$ & $\\eu^u + c$\\\\", "$\\cos x$ & $\\sin x + c$ &", "$\\dfrac{u'}{\\sqrt u} \\ (u>0)$ & $2\\sqrt u + c$\\\\", "$\\sin x$ & $-\\cos x + c$ & &", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "", "\\begin{method}[识别 $u' \\times (\\text{ 某式，关于 } u)$ 形式]\\label{met:g12:integ:uprime}", "求积分时，若被积式为乘积，则寻找一个因子，它是某内函数 ", "$u$ 的导数（相差一个常数倍）。例如在", "$\\int_0^1 x\\,\\eu^{x^2}\\dd x$ 中，因子 $x$ 为 $\\frac12 (x^2)'$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 x\\,\\eu^{x^2}\\dd x = \\frac12\\left[\\eu^{x^2}\\right]_0^1", "= \\frac{\\eu - 1}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[分部积分法]\\label{thm:g12:integ:ibp}", "\\index{分部积分法}", "设 $u, v$ 在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上可导，且导函数连续。", "则", "\\[", "\\int_a^b u'(t)\\,v(t)\\,\\dd t", "= \\bigl[u(t)\\,v(t)\\bigr]_a^b - \\int_a^b u(t)\\,v'(t)\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由乘积法则得 $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$，", "在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上两边积分，并对左端用微积分基本定理，", "得 $\\bigl[uv\\bigr]_a^b = \\int_a^b u'v + \\int_a^b uv'$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g12:integ:ibp}", "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 t\\,\\eu^{t}\\,\\dd t$：取 $u' = \\eu^t$，$v = t$，", "于是 $u = \\eu^t$，$v' = 1$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 t\\,\\eu^t\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[t\\,\\eu^t\\bigr]_0^1 - \\int_0^1 \\eu^t\\,\\dd t", "= \\eu - (\\eu - 1) = 1 .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", ""]}